9. SAFETY NOTICE

The Software includes ECU coding, ECU flashing, key adaptation, component
protection and EEPROM functionality. Misuse of these features can
permanently damage or "brick" an electronic control unit in a vehicle, with
consequences ranging from non-functional accessories to an undriveable or
unsafe vehicle. ERDesigns accepts no responsibility for any such damage. By
using the coding, flashing or other write functionality you accept full
responsibility for the consequences.

Read docs/flashing-safety.md before using TOBDFlasher, TOBDFlashPipeline,
TOBDCodingSession or any other component that writes to a real vehicle.


